(()=>{const milestones=[['QUESTION FRAMING','Start with a decision.','The luxury-watch study frames a retailer’s assortment question, explores product attributes and compares statistical price relationships. The football project connects sporting and financial data to an academic valuation proposal.','Watch: exploratory analysis, correlation and ANOVA. Football: data integration, historical financial views and explicit limits on valuation claims.','watch-case-study.html','Explore the watch study ↗','Validate an assortment hypothesis using customer research and a measured pilot, rather than treating catalog patterns as demand.'],['DATA QUALITY','Make assumptions visible.','The retail data-wrangling coursework and portfolio audit examine missing values, duplicates and business-rule consistency. Preparing the data becomes part of the evidence, rather than an invisible preliminary step.','The audit checks three saved outputs covering 1,491 rows and identifies 40 unresolved order-total inconsistencies in the missing-data output.','wrangling-case-study.html','Explore the data-quality audit ↗','Recover raw records, reconcile the flagged values and maintain a traceable change log before claiming a fully repaired dataset.'],['MODEL EVALUATION','Compare performance honestly.','Wine regression, stock baselines, NLP and survey modelling develop complementary evaluation skills: compare methods, choose metrics that match the task and inspect failures as well as aggregate scores.','The wine study exposes training/test gaps; stock uses chronological holdouts; the NLP baseline separates intent accuracy, macro-F1 and entity F1.','wine-case-study.html','Explore model evaluation ↗','Use fold-local preprocessing, stronger baselines and uncertainty estimates; validate performance on genuinely new observations.'],['DATA ENGINEERING','Connect the analytical stages.','The EV repository demonstrates Airflow ingestion, cleaning and Elasticsearch indexing. The building-energy case study adds Spark-based processing and modelling, with its report evidence and limitations made explicit.','EV: Python DAG and saved Kibana figures. Building energy: Spark workflow and reported model comparison. Live operation of the original environments is not claimed.','ev-case-study.html','Explore the EV pipeline ↗','Package reproducible environments, add data contracts and pipeline monitoring, and test repeatable loading against a documented source snapshot.'],['COMMUNICATION','Make the evidence explorable.','The environmental dashboard connects filters, facility locations and industry-to-substance flows. Interactive portfolio case studies add model comparisons, notebook access and clear findings for readers with different technical backgrounds.','The browser-based dashboard uses saved project data; case studies distinguish observed records, synthetic examples, saved results and newly executed baselines.','shiny-case-study.html','Explore the interactive dashboard ↗','Test the experience with users, improve accessibility and measure whether people can interpret the charts and their limitations correctly.']];const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-milestone]')];buttons.forEach((b,i)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach((x,j)=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===j)));const [k,t,d,p,url,label,next]=milestones[i];document.getElementById('milestone-kicker').textContent='MILESTONE 0'+(i+1)+' / '+k;document.getElementById('milestone-title').textContent=t;document.getElementById('milestone-description').textContent=d;document.getElementById('milestone-proof').textContent=p;const link=document.getElementById('milestone-link');link.href=url;link.textContent=label;document.getElementById('milestone-next').textContent=next;}));})();
